      "message": "This hook would allow vendor modules to skip the dm-verity check.  I think this is a great example of why vendor hooks in security-relevant components is a bad idea.\n\nPlease consider using the `try_verify_in_tasklet` option, which eliminates the dm-verity scheduling overhead in many cases, which seems to be what you\u0027re trying to achieve.  It was recently improved by the following commits:\n\n* FROMGIT: dm-verity: support block number limits for different ioprio classes\n* FROMGIT: dm-bufio: don\u0027t schedule in atomic context\n* FROMGIT: dm-verity: use softirq context only when !need_resched()\n\nAdditionally, please ensure your Android build includes https://r.android.com/q/topic:%22dm-verity-max-age-seconds%22, which fixed the Merkle tree block cache to not expire so quickly.\n\nIf there are remaining issues, please collaborate with us and upstream to fix them.",
